Gouda here. Four taps and you have a practice plan. Not sure and Skip are always there.
```yui
plan@first "Your first practice plan" submit="Build my practice"
choose@instrument "What do you play?" "Guitar"|"Piano"|"Drums"|"Bass"|"Voice"|"Not yet"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
choose@level "How would you rate yourself?" "Brand new"|"Know a few things"|"Getting there"|"Pretty good"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
choose@minutes "Minutes a day?" "10"|"20"|"30"|"An hour"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
pick@want "What do you want to play?" "Songs"|"Scales"|"Chords"|"Make my own"|"Play by ear"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
end
```
